			"Message": "docs(Grove): Revamp README and architecture docs with Land branding, emoji, and updated component paths\n\nAlign the README.md and Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md with the current codebase state and Land project visual identity:\n\n- Normalize all emoji separators from double-wide spaces to \\u2001 (em-quad) for consistent rendering\n- Append Land emoji (🌳, 🏞️, ⛰️, 🦋, 🌫️) after every Grove, Land, Mountain, Cocoon, and Mist mention for project branding\n- Update badge versions: Rust 1.75→1.95.0+, add Edition 2024 badge, WASMtime v20→v45\n- Reflect API/VSCode.rs→API/VSCode/ directory structure with 13 submodules\n- Reflect Activation.rs→Activation/ module with 6 submodule files\n- Reflect FunctionExport.rs→FunctionExport/ module with 6 submodule files\n- Reflect SpineActionClient.rs→SpineActionClient/ module with 8 submodule files\n- Add Protocol/ submodules (Constants, MessageType, ProtocolConfig, ProtocolError)\n- Add Transport submodules (TransportConfig, TransportFactory)\n- Update gRPC port from 50052→50051 to match Vine.proto\n- Add Cargo features: websocket, telemetry, dev, debug alongside existing features\n- Update code examples to use ExtensionHostImpl and typed activation patterns\n- Add fuel metering to WASM runtime security description\n- Append License, Changelog, and Project Maintainers sections to README\n- Collapse sponsor table cells to single-line HTML for consistency\n\nThe documentation now accurately mirrors the actual file tree and build configuration.",
